<article class="env-proposition" id="37047A">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/37047A">Proposition <span data-tag="37047A">6.3.5.14</span>.</a> Let $\calX $ be an $\infty $-topos, and let $\chi : \calX \rightarrow \LGeom ^{op}_{/ \calX }$ be the functor of Remark <a href="/tag/E2FC8B" data-tag="E2FC8B">6.3.5.10</a>. Then $\chi $ preserves small colimits. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Combine Propositions <a href="/tag/9233A3" data-tag="9233A3">1.2.13.8</a>, <a href="/tag/39ADD2" data-tag="39ADD2">6.3.2.3</a>, and Theorem <a href="/tag/53AECD" data-tag="53AECD">6.1.3.9</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>